From: Semih Baskan <strst.gs@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: BCM5301X: EA9200: add port 5 as a second CPU port

The EA9200 uses port 8 as its only CPU port. Enable port 5 (gmac0) as
well, with the same fixed-link as port 8, so wan can be moved to it at
runtime with the b53 change in 703.

Signed-off-by: Semih Baskan <strst.gs@gmail.com>
---
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm4709-linksys-ea9200.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm4709-linksys-ea9200.dts
@@ -214,7 +214,12 @@
 		};
 
 		port@5 {
-			status = "disabled";
+			label = "cpu";
+
+			fixed-link {
+				speed = <1000>;
+				full-duplex;
+			};
 		};
 
 		port@7 {
